window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After the excitement of a new baby, all Maggie Phillips wants to do on New Year’s Eve is couch-surf and spend a little quality time with her husband. Unfortunately, Leo’s determined to drag her and Neil out to a fabulous New Year’s Eve masquerade. But when a van-load of masked villains crash the bash a few hours before midnight, the hag’s in over her head once more. </p> <p>Start the New Year off right with a fresh misadventure from the Queen of Whodunits. It says so on the internet, so it must be true!</p>"; 
